cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these results, please cite the thesis What activation patching shows (Chapter 8, https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24555440) and this repository."
title: "First-order estimates find the influential cell types in the FlyVis models but misjudge their silencing effects: code and results"
abstract: "Compares first-order (gradient) estimates of silencing each of the 65 cell types with exact silencing in the 50 released FlyVis models of the fly visual system, and traces the estimates' errors to the nonlinearity of the direction-selectivity readout."
